Since $\|\mathbf{a} \times \mathbf{v}\|$ represents the area of the parallelogram spanned by vectors $\mathbf{a}$ and $\mathbf{v},$ this means that the area of the parallelogram spanned by vectors $\mathbf{a}$ and $\mathbf{a} \times \mathbf{c}$ is 1.

